# Weather

Client-direct Open-Meteo — no snapshot in git, no API key. Full tier only; light = no fetch, no UI. Soft-fail to nothing; never `markLight()`.

## Must preserve

- Coords: `baglioLocation` courtyard lat/lon. CSP `connect-src` includes `https://api.open-meteo.com`.
- CC BY credit on the map whenever weather shows (`https://open-meteo.com/`).
- Meteocons **monochrome** SVGs in `static/images/weather/`; paint via CSS mask / `currentColor`.
- Unit tests use fixtures — no live Open-Meteo in CI.
- **One component, one fetch** in `WeatherChip.svelte` — do not split across context/children (Svelte 5 reactivity breaks).

## Layout (`portraitMobile` from `PORTRAIT_ASPECT_QUERY`, same as homepage Chi siamo)

| | Landscape | Portrait |
|---|---|---|
| Chip | Overlay top-center on map | Block below map |
| Open-Meteo credit | Bottom-left on map | Bottom-left on map |
| OSM credit | Bottom-right (Leaflet) | Bottom-right (Leaflet) |

Attribution labels short (`© Open-Meteo`, `© OpenStreetMap`); fuller text in `title` only.
